# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings on every OS. GitHub's Windows runners set
# core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise convert them to CRLF: bash fails on the carriage
# returns of the shell scripts, and the bindings test (crates/mi-types/tests/bindings.rs)
# compares the committed TypeScript types byte for byte with freshly generated ones (LF).
* text=auto eol=lf
